00:34:57,701 --> 00:35:05,960
Williams was convicted of murder and is serving a life sentence based solely on the hair and fiber evidence presented at trial.

468
00:35:08,080 --> 00:35:15,840
When evidence needs to be broken down into its very elemental structure, the chemistry unit begins its meticulous work.

