00:35:31,801 --> 00:35:37,240
In the lab, the chem unit detected sodium carbonate

472
00:35:37,241 --> 00:35:39,700
a chemical usually found in cleaning powder

473
00:35:39,701 --> 00:35:41,400
on pieces of the wreckage

474
00:35:41,401 --> 00:35:46,940
